# Gallformers local development environment
#
# Development needs no secrets:
#   - admin login uses the dev auth bypass (config/dev.exs);
#   - the private bucket is on local disk (tmp/private_storage);
#   - the database is the dev shell's Postgres (direnv allow; make db-start).
#
# Never put production credentials here or in your shell profile. Production's
# live in Fly secrets and GitHub secrets. The runbooks ask for an operator's
# Postgres credentials in the terminal, only for the step that needs them. The
# AWS CLI signs in with `aws login` (temporary credentials), not access keys.
#
# Only non-secret local settings belong here, e.g.:
# TILES_URL=https://gallformers.org/tiles/boundaries.pmtiles
